{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/37b783c043400655addc62e0e4bd3501.avif?t=1772066263\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras_big/37b783c043400655addc62e0e4bd3501.webp?t=1772066263 width=1560 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this \u201cHistory\u201d from Earth, 2102 AD! As an already invincible you, you and your best friend will build the legendary Ramen Dino on a deserted island! Gather ingredients and hire employees in wild, unconventional ways. Run your shop quietly and lawfully\u2026 or seize resources through intense, unprecedented battles! Amid countless open-world adventures, uncover the truth behind \u201chuman extinction.\u201d Reconnect the divided people of this isolated island with takeout and delicious food! As the mysterious rabbit-man Alicell, you will save the ARKPARK once again!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre creatures (robots), cute and mischievous BBs, invaders from outer space\u2026 and you, who just wants to run a ramen shop! Treasure hidden under coconut trees? Collecting all kinds of ingredients? Ships that sink immediately? The owner of the mysterious device? The \u201cIsland Master\u201d pulling all the strings behind the scenes? And your amazing friends!!! Nothing can stop you from continuing your story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are already invincible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for seawater!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an invincible cosmic life form \u2014 ALICELL \u2014 your greatest enemies are those who try to push you into the water\u2026 and\u2026 everyone weaker than you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWith this invincible power\u2026 will you save, destroy\u2026 or just open a ramen shop? Wani!!!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer adventures with friends in the big open world!!! All ALICELLs are split from the original body! Jump on their heads to become a mobile turret! Fight together, eat together, run under the sunset together, dominate everyone together\u2026 or\u2026 make them hand over their loot!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo you really expect a great hero who saved the World Island to unclog a toilet???\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGimme that!!!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.poster.avif?t=1772066263\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.webm?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.mp4?t=1772066263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This blue planet once bore four civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fifth is now nearing its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just an interlude before the final judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the long years make you forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You once got knocked into the sea by Orange Kid\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why won\u2019t anyone come to the ramen shop?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not enough wood for building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m reporting the game devs!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown regions\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealed high cities\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world drifting further apart\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All are the price of this beautiful paradise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can \u201cDestiny\u201d be anti?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just an alien,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mass of \u201cAstral Essence\u201d that happened to gain self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your friends never see you that way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of ArkPARK awaits your answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BIGBOSS ALICELL","path":"https://cdn.a